":"一筛凉雨歇亭皋，菡萏无香可得消。\n玉簟怯秋眠未稳，阿谁楼上夜吹箫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26196,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古断肠曲三十首 其八","author":"周端臣","text":"香凝薇帐春风院，酒涴榴裙夜月楼。\n閒把花枝思往事，旧欢都变作新愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26197,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古断肠曲三十首 其七","author":"周端臣","text":"无计消除夜漏长，罗衾熏彻旧时香。\n十分又是凄愁处，雨歇芭蕉小院凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26198,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古断肠曲三十首 其六","author":"周端臣","text":"梦破巫山生色屏，锦囊情薄歇馀馨。\n关河春晚无消息，肠断楼前杨柳青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26199,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古断肠曲三十首 其五","author":"周端臣","text":"条风窗户柳阴阴，云碧春衫熨水沉。\n花里小栏人不到，流莺啼起去年心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26200,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古断肠曲三十首 其四","author":"周端臣","text":"竹叶裙纱摺摺香，荷风占断晚西凉。\n年来欢事愁边减，别后秋更梦外长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26201,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古断肠曲三十首 其三","author":"周端臣","text":"被拥娇寒晓梦春，起来无事翠眉颦。\n金瓶拈得双青杏，掐破中心见个人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26202,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古断肠曲三十首 其二","author":"周端臣","text":"催花一霎雨依微，芳径泥香草色萋。\n可是一春天气冷，牡丹开了未莺啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26203,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古断肠曲三十首 其一","author":"周端臣","text":"髻云松滑亸鸾钗，清减羞临玉镜台。\n蛱蝶也知人寂寞，一双飞过杏墙来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26204,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早冬湖上","author":"周端臣","text":"晴湖水落葑田乾，白鸟飞来立晚寒。\n杨柳不知秋已远，尚摇疏翠拂栏干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26205,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邻园晚步","author":"周端臣","text":"忽然杨柳几丝风，零落桃花数片红。\n满面好春吟不得，一园蝴蝶过墙东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26206,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"买木犀花","author":"周端臣","text":"拚却杖头沽酒物，湖边博得木犀花。\n西风可是无拘束，一路吹香直到家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26207,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜归","author":"周端臣","text":"侧侧梅寒恋客衣，市楼灯比旧年稀。\n酒徒歌伴凋零尽，独自吟诗月下归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26208,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春月送人","author":"周端臣","text":"一湖春绿染初成，柳色东风二月晴。\n燕子来时人却别，梨花虽好负清明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26209,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晓","author":"周端臣","text":"一抹凉烟晓未收，露篱疏雨湿牵牛。\n不知天上秋多少，昨夜西风到小楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26210,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晚孤山","author":"周端臣","text":"山夹寒云晚不收，蘋花洲渚雁声秋。\n西湖处士无消息，落日丹枫处处愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26211,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"周端臣","text":"一洒斑斑小雨晴，杖藜随意散幽情。\n不论城市山林地，才有梅花处便清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26212,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清明湖上","author":"周端臣","text":"谁家园里一声莺，啼向春风似有情。\n惊起少年游冶兴，插花沽酒醉清明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26213,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒食湖堤","author":"周端臣","text":"紫陌笙歌簇禁烟，几年无此好晴天。\n画桥日晚游人醉，花插满头扶上船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26214,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上归","author":"周端臣","text":"别却吴姬旧酒垆，扁舟吹笛过平湖。\n晚云又是商量雨，遮得秋山一半无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26215,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖山园","author":"周端臣","text":"丹楼碧阁面山开，绿树红芳绕水栽。\n多少好春閒过却，主人无暇不曾来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26216,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"落叶","author":"周端臣","text":"西风不管鹊巢寒，成阵飘来响更乾。\n最是山房秋思客，梦回疑作雨声看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26217,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遣兴寄徐抱独","author":"周端臣","text":"楼外垂杨啼晓鸦，楼中倦客醉思家。\n东风不管春将半，一夜清寒勒杏花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26218,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题真妃出浴图","author":"周端臣","text":"百媚千娇出浴时，君王凝盼转魂迷。\n香肌犹恐红绡重，可忍他年践马蹄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26219,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书冷泉亭壁","author":"周端臣","text":"一酌野泉香，翛然俗虑忘。\n静听山鸟语，如笑世人忙。\n近水苔常湿，无风树亦凉。\n老僧閒似我，清坐到斜阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26220,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代上刘郎中","author":"周端臣","text":"弹压江湖耸市朝，相逢人尽说风骚。\n诗从南岳吟逾老，名得西山荐益高。\n半世历官才幕府，午年还国尚郎曹。\n儿时曾诵先生句，镜里如今已二毛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26221,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古剑","author":"周端臣","text":"籀文漫灭藓花残，胆怯旁人不敢看。\n飞去暗防风雨夜，握来光射斗牛寒。\n曾成歃血诸侯约，肯受无鱼下客弹。\n宝匣秘藏英气在，提携终拟斩楼兰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":26222,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]